(113,'D1351','PREVENTIVE','sealant - per tooth','One (1) per tooth per lifetime up to age sixteen (16).','Sealants are a benefit of most dental plans, with a few exceptions. When covered, sealants are allowed for permanent molars only.','Tooth Identification'),
(114,'D1352','PREVENTIVE','preventive resin restoration in a moderate to high caries-risk patient; permanent tooth','One (1) per tooth per lifetime up to age sixteen (16).','Sealants are a benefit of most dental plans, with a few exceptions. When covered, sealants are allowed for permanent molars only.','Tooth Identification'),
