(140,'D2330','RESTORATIVE','resin-based composite - one surface, anterior','One (1) restoration per surface per tooth per twelve (12) month period','Limited to one (1) surface (I, M, D, B, and L) per twelve (12) month period regardless of materials used and how many separate restorations share the same surface.\r\nExample: Two (2) separate restorations, ML and DL will be paid as D2332 MLD, or MFD.','Tooth identification, Surface identification'),
