(328,'D5410','PROSTHODONTICS, REMOVABLE','adjust complete denture - maxillary','Two (2) per calendar year, age fifteen (15) and older.','Coverage is available six (6) months after the date of insertion of the complete or partial denture. Two (2) adjustments are allowed per arch per calendar year. Patient must be age fifteen (15) or older.','None'),
