(332,'D5511','PROSTHODONTICS, REMOVABLE','repair broken complete denture base, mandibular','One (1) per calendar year, age fifteen (15) and older.','Six (6) months must have elapsed since insertion of the denture, or the services will be disallowed. One (1) repair per year. The patient must be age fifteen (15) or older.','None'),
