(334,'D5520','PROSTHODONTICS, REMOVABLE','replace missing or broken teeth - complete denture (per tooth)','One (1) per calendar year, age fifteen (15) and older.','Six (6) months must have elapsed since insertion of the denture, or the services will be disallowed. Once per denture tooth per year. The patient must be age fifteen (15) or older.','Tooth identification'),
(335,'D5611','PROSTHODONTICS, REMOVABLE','repair resin partial denture base, mandibular','One (1) per calendar year, age fifteen (15) and older.','Six (6) months must have elapsed since insertion of the denture, or the services will be disallowed. Coverage will be paid according to plan benefits, or once a year if the plan does not have another limitation. The patient must be age fifteen (15) or older.','None'),
